      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oregonia%2C_Ohio",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Oregonia sits on the east shore of the Little Miami River, about five miles northeast of Lebanon and six miles south of Waynesville.",
